  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Alors, nous partagerons l’entrée. Apportez les plats à notre rythme, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "4fe3ae9bc1c27dff18cdd34a786485877ae7e524fd7f956a0b0109fee6ef3c30",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Apportez les plats à notre rythme, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "2afe0e68d17059026029bc3e614e0be2f5b03baa4a2f0904da3b21ae9aee2eb6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Attendez avant de servir le plat principal, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "bbe6af16c2ab6cfc8ed433e6d50e2c2f444e7575e00faa227b127961270cb53a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Avez-vous une préférence pour le vin ?",
      "textSHA256": "938f89e501c60865a52a4c974e5aaabf272afe15342c4a4a31d1601439f4868b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Je peux apporter deux assiettes.",
      "textSHA256": "75b2d19f21e2ce1fec6678e038844fbbe29e409120d35fad5bff85b671bde548",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Je vais attendre avant de servir le plat principal.",
      "textSHA256": "7fc9c5cc41dbeb309d6d746ef55edf24b0218e92835e624002476141282ecbe6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Qu’allez-vous manger ?",
      "textSHA256": "c441a4958e5c93cf7cfafdff24c2a7ffd4e2c1d00631da1ec19636291e7fb097",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Avez-vous choisi vos plats ?",
      "textSHA256": "f0a121c1302121e94388c6ad89cd0d9aac790f7db53f15323e2d6f8a46f774f4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Avez-vous choisi votre plat ?",
      "textSHA256": "97fff801c3073d156da6fb7ba97d7c1fe7346543c27486e3530192b3a4eac08d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Comment préparez-vous le poisson entier ?",
      "textSHA256": "5c520432311c3bd304010f296117d0a7dcf2663fc6181e8ede69b023838d5735",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Dans quel ordre servez-vous les plats ?",
      "textSHA256": "57d18838f7319366a448689ba7445ee3c735c7f90f82e7716e2b55f68531779a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Quelle est la spécialité de la maison ?",
      "textSHA256": "ad34021dca1d325106c014d19e38dc458ade7cfa24bac3b0f3d18c2dd72fc4a7",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. Voulez-vous entendre nos suggestions du jour ?",
      "textSHA256": "7da2a591524f93a83c9ae13867d4ac8b687d2b606166f1370a264d23f984f9fe",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ce plat contient-il des arachides ?",
      "textSHA256": "e32355e9392d6dd1f88727bf26563825d1c9e7fabd391df571aab516ebe92710",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ce soir, c’est la daube provençale.",
      "textSHA256": "f078172eef47cdc4143ef7b07420743a6e09bfbd03085905dfd30a9743f2ffc9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ce vin rouge de la région est léger et fruité.",
      "textSHA256": "25cb8d206b26bf565379d5e10535af8dde8701b60078973d2b7b901e9b8e9897",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Cette bouteille coûte trente-six euros.",
      "textSHA256": "713773948c4047c6c509424bbfbdf812cd8506d9cf7406cda947faf54bc222a2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Combien de plats conseillez-vous pour deux personnes ?",
      "textSHA256": "fcd3d7a55b55d3952607b12b26c228d0ec98224f61556ab9e16c038abd1e6c96",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 12
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Comment préparez-vous le poisson ?",
      "textSHA256": "5a5068fb941d8170a03c6e9739dfb31f2649a2e9ca7c46a984a7555193f41716",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "C’est un plat de bœuf mijoté au vin, servi avec des légumes.",
      "textSHA256": "d6bac6eb569394016ed080f975f139c34d4920fae2568a2e6eaa408d18461610",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Dans ce cas, je ne prendrai pas le poulet frit. Je prendrai le poulet grillé, sans sauce.",
      "textSHA256": "d1f2eaadee38cc32ef13a4568d1895f1cfc1b3086a33a770f15ad130c747e169",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Dans quel ordre servez-vous les plats ?",
      "textSHA256": "d65b313766a90ab0118258c710a248d6b5ece15cf0c7d8fd2617c908735ebf34",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Donc, à combien reviendrait ce poisson ?",
      "textSHA256": "f2a3535a45c72aaa9694fcb7ed0e4e8ef62933c432212bb81144924e33e2c1a2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Du poulet rôti. Quel vin local conseillez-vous avec le poulet ?",
      "textSHA256": "ab355168f4ac7dfa7e2de2ef6d19db753307e5c141e781b8e8113d903d44ca46",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "D’accord. Je reprendrai le service quand vous serez prêts.",
      "textSHA256": "b1b4fedc20d7dce493c453bd19295d0a5387d83041fbe5573eb15a422c65db13",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Est-ce que le poisson du jour est épuisé ?",
      "textSHA256": "1349392630f72de8fb8ebfd1c10bb478752301fc20ce2aea9a8a2f56bb714bf4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il est sec et accompagne bien le poulet.",
      "textSHA256": "c3e8c0523367de4d51f55047b06eed070325b6e5dc3aa753def5516d65569e0b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il est à trente euros le kilo. Celui-ci pèse environ un kilo.",
      "textSHA256": "db80e9871bf6bcba59111088a5cdbd5352fa295671aa055be7eec2f522714dd7",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il nous faut plus de temps entre les plats.",
      "textSHA256": "4807f6fbf8637d5b237b9905615d9fe422534b2a69dad8c43f7571c39749af9d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je cherche un vin rouge léger.",
      "textSHA256": "8bed6f927a73853a18530c4f2f0e0f8b4c9af8a02559d93c17ea209f48c49e87",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je demanderai aussi pour le dessert.",
      "textSHA256": "82b30cdeec35b043748f4f1e58d8bce7b8aeab46445f00a7f00e612396912bbd",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je note le poulet grillé, sans sauce.",
      "textSHA256": "ccfb65eff5b80f1085876deca5bb10477e5fb64c27092478096ce1d5bba2b5a0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je n’ai pas compris. Pourriez-vous répéter ?",
      "textSHA256": "7418bec2c884cfe044ba2a51234021c15e6ac48610ec7cb10a9dbebd2f1ff88e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je prendrai la salade en accompagnement.",
      "textSHA256": "669077f93678de6ddd5a5c7f5588be7a5d4b80fea85bd51c3a1d51ac798c2561",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je prendrai la salade. Quel est le prix au kilo ?",
      "textSHA256": "21097d3172a79561551e9c7126b54be148c7f2d058faf22288c23fb3856ef245",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je prendrai le poulet grillé, sans sauce.",
      "textSHA256": "52e6fc5b2cbe19a90ae73cf10229ebb38da547f1c99ad053b669a5cfd669c924",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je préfère un vin sec, pas trop sucré.",
      "textSHA256": "7e5e3f79caff141d9b2fda3c53f9240edeba8a03e2b33be00eb897198d028d72",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vais demander au cuisinier et je reviens.",
      "textSHA256": "eeffff154aa0fd3b0edabd8199e52f2ed3064dc73201e74cd88f470a10368e12",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vais vérifier les ingrédients de la sauce.",
      "textSHA256": "2d9d500c3328fb7b506bf4b80f9b50810aaea1138bd67c1b1e4074e180bedcf6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais un plat typique de la région.",
      "textSHA256": "accbb5155a062c01cc52cd976a575606d4038e796749fd1c57eb137627ac6d7c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais un plat typique de la région. Je prendrai la daube, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "4c6ecb4a0abba3358c420c44c0c9ce872ef4bd98af441f23591d97d81105e764",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vous apporte la bouteille.",
      "textSHA256": "cd022fd8a52a2e896a5d05579b8aa7508c8f316fcb8c6b6431f886b1bf128d06",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J’ai une allergie aux arachides.",
      "textSHA256": "e370d9f983f5fe0c260c6edda84bf740cbcc97bee63a521e2b6a9ce35a358f01",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J’ai une allergie aux arachides. Ce plat contient-il des arachides ?",
      "textSHA256": "6392d8758052c3aaf0fed4ba852087a67ac5707bcc6b41d8493a6054562bb92f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La portion de ce plat est-elle grande ?",
      "textSHA256": "1e50fc12f2d4a8b9374e99081a0ae09be1c870dc26cfe9bcc9682abf7fd05e42",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La portion est-elle grande ?",
      "textSHA256": "c17cc75ff11f891538f14347ccf242748f0c790f82c5439b79e14889b18b3b9d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La sauce ne contient pas d’arachides.",
      "textSHA256": "81959dedef934b19892fb8e320c7717db58c4d55455409d0d58b1d3a106dfef4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le cuisinier utilise la même friteuse pour plusieurs plats.",
      "textSHA256": "155724d531738bde05d7faa96f107fb6a93d6e31944faee5f6b59ef46ea939fc",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le plat principal arrive déjà.",
      "textSHA256": "52df14d529e16ae10f30bf19dfe433c51afffd30635ab4642e2b1e7898b36d12",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le prix total estimé est de trente euros.",
      "textSHA256": "a21eb20830b2db96c62a85f98173ca483ca462e8ee3419d6a4d260761347e2f8",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Les courges et les champignons sont de saison.",
      "textSHA256": "09b35308fe778ebea3d6b4353e89f99cb5ffebc3ce660a5ac7b5e756d6331b99",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci. Nous commençons à peine l’entrée.",
      "textSHA256": "672259f2898d7fa47821769a61fa7c4d715b53f462c2db0dc7dce923195b1cc2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci. Nous prendrons cette bouteille.",
      "textSHA256": "dfd34467a19f8498b290673c53f2e1693a2633598bf177fa18f2c2bcee82a3be",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Mon budget est de quarante euros pour la bouteille.",
      "textSHA256": "3a08eb1ab06e08daa72722bd5afa19e0cf49861ee2db3f7e357c6ac60d01dd0b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Mon budget est de quarante euros pour la bouteille. À combien est celle-ci ?",
