      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:5:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous avons un poisson entier grillé, vendu au kilo.",
      "textSHA256": "9dd8aac9a3f66e94edff5e4df24ace1eac57809a6a38e874e834d35df22a603a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous le faisons griller. Il est vendu au kilo.",
      "textSHA256": "59fb2f63b016c2e65d224c05d28f0541dc893563dce25b5d67f0b63c8802a467",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous servons d’abord l’entrée, puis le plat principal et enfin le dessert.",
      "textSHA256": "9a2cbf343953c78c3db3a859c4463b34cfa05ba0b5b3b2fb9a4411097efd2759",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous sommes prêts pour le dessert maintenant.",
      "textSHA256": "f143e7ccd0dd7088dfcb240b074b093363ec9f9a77c360beae99dae3c76ae374",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oh, nous mangeons encore l’entrée. Plus doucement, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "d0b0c39f04f37a2cb7d91bfb655813ac509ba33950cf5976be80553121c8031f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, c’est un poisson entier avec des arêtes.",
      "textSHA256": "a77e965e0742c885ae4a31ac71e9d54ee56897024198c2bbdba731bcb20a8df6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, elle est assez grande.",
      "textSHA256": "fdceea171707d36a7e2033e8c11b5f0b410ae1d31180a8a748af7bd7c18e7cef",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, il est épuisé. Nous avons encore la daube.",
      "textSHA256": "fccda11f7475406bb1de946a7a5dd07e7d928a8d9caae7bd21fb50ee6dcbe33b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:6:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui. Dites-moi quand vous serez prêts pour la suite.",
      "textSHA256": "15278d780efa3b4c20651151ca3bfdfb598a09f0c31f7206b47b603058dd7733",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Plus doucement, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "6e074941a4bc7942cb20d35e5b1f16ba5b1308ce97b559abdc606eab3a95b721",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pour commencer, nous prendrons une entrée.",
      "textSHA256": "83d46ffbfc66c5b759bf6808a6bc3c5bfe30d1504083a7942a42d3e0e7a73227",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:4:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pour le dessert, je demanderai aussi quels sont les ingrédients.",
      "textSHA256": "c530750510040973c76935498a005076176a4cd183c64186e48d4e0c42c1fba9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous accélérer un peu le service ?",
